msgid "For more information on the diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian function, visit the [API docs](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion#diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian).\n"
msgstr "Para sa higit pang impormasyon tungkol sa function na diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian, bisitahin ang [API docs](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/fermion#diagonalize_fermionic_hamiltonian).\n"
